The bindings are in the bindings.js file found here https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/inst/www/binding.js.

You will see heatMapOutput adding this js file to the output.

The renderHeatMap function here https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/R/heatmap.R#L65 sends data to the binding, which is then processed and used to construct the heatmap.

I would recommend that you read this tutorial http://rstudio.github.io/shiny/tutorial/#building-outputs on building outputs. It provides you with a detailed overview of the things you need to do to set up bindings.

