I think you can safely ignore the warnings. They were probably due to
the fact that you have already loaded the shiny package before
installing the new version, e.g.

library(shiny)

devtools::install_github("shiny", "rstudio")

You'd better start a clean R session and install packages. If you are
in RStudio, use the menu Session --> Restart R.

Regards,
Yihui

