Hi Alan,

Check the docs for navlistPanel -- it actually creates it's own 12-wide sub-container with the navlist on the left and the content on the right. There is a widths parameter that controls the proportions -- it defaults to c(4, 8), so what you are seeing is that navlist occupying 33% of the 6 columns you defined for it.

J.J.

