Vincent,

For common UI elements, one solution is to include them in either the navbarPage header or footer (you can specify these using parameters to navbarPage, and both can take lists of arbitrary elements).

This might or might not work for your application though. I'm not sure what the right answer is for sharing UI elements across tabs -- do others have experience with this? This might be something we need to add a feature to Shiny to enable.

J.J.

