It looks like github is somehow blocked from your machine - that is probably why install_github failed.

I believe that the reason that installing the master.zip file didn't work is because that is an unbuilt package, whereas RStudio expects to install a built package. To install an unbuilt package, you should first unzip the file, then use the `install` function from devtools:
 devtools::install('path/to/packagedir')

-Winston

